// Auglaize County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search, the Board of Elections, the GIS map and the St. Marys chamber) were
// checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * stmaryschamber.org is now the St. Marys, PENNSYLVANIA chamber. The Ohio
//     chamber is stmarysohio.org.
//   * smriders.org no longer resolves; St. Marys City Schools is smriders.net.
//   * seemore.org redirects to grandlakeregion.com (Grand Lake Region Visitors
//     Bureau, St. Marys), which serves Auglaize and Mercer.
//   * The Auditor's property search is Tyler iasWorld at auditoraccess.auglaizecounty.org,
//     not Data Dynamics.
//   * The Board of Elections moved from auglaize.boe.ohio.gov to
//     boe.ohio.gov/auglaize; EMA moved to auglaizeema.org; Veterans Service to
//     augvsc.org.
//   * Uniopolis disincorporated into Union Township; it is no longer a village.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   St. Marys (PA, WV, GA, KS), New Bremen (NY), Minster (UK);
//   washington-twp.com is Washington Township in LUCAS County; the Holy Rosary
//   school site that surfaces in search is Rosenberg, TEXAS; the Catholic
//   Telegraph's "St. Mary's School" story is Greenville (Darke County). The West
//   Central Ohio Port Authority is a Clark County body.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Two cities (Wapakoneta, St. Marys), six villages (Buckland, Cridersville,
//     Minster, New Bremen, New Knoxville, Waynesfield), fourteen townships.
//     Buckland has no site; the county's links page wrongly gives it Minster's.
//     Only Duchouquet Township has its own site; the county's Township Trustees
//     page covers the rest.
//   * No county building department: township trustees issue building permits.
//   * Eight school districts based in neighbouring counties take in parts of
//     Auglaize townships (listed and flagged). Apollo Career Center is in Lima.
//   * New Bremen and Minster libraries are branches of the county system;
//     St. Marys has its own library.
//   * Grand Lake St. Marys is shared with Mercer County. Lake Loramie (Shelby),
//     Fort Recovery and Maria Stein (Mercer) are excluded.
//   * Lima TV market (WLIO / Hometown Stations).
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: the Neil Armstrong Airport's own site
// (does not load; the county's airport page is used), the Recorder's Kofile
// search, NKTelco (would not load), the Wapakoneta YMCA, Summer Moon Festival,
// Habitat and community foundations (no first-party sites found), the closed
// St. Joseph School, and Head Start, Health Partners and the Family Resource
// Center (no Auglaize location on their own sites).

